WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Four sheets, four jobs
Captioned sample walkthrough. Fictional Larkspur Cottage. Actual sample PDF excerpts; no customer footage.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Cleaner: work and record
The example cleaner sheet spans two pages: work order, room tasks, photo prompts and counts.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:48.000
Host: inspect and compare
Check room references, photos received and inspection notes.

00:00:48.000 --> 00:01:08.000
Restock: record quantities
Use par, reorder-below and stock-today fields for consumables.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Report: record exceptions
Record missing or damaged items, maintenance issues and overruns.

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:38.000
What this does not prove
Four sheet types; the included cleaner sheet is two pages. This is a fictional sample, not a completed real-property inspection.

00:01:38.000 --> 00:01:50.000
